{"id":"n54012-1-9","stage":2,"title":"동 · 洞","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n54012-1-9-1","ko":"너는 학교에 올 때 혼자 오니?","zh":"你来学校的时候是独自一人来的吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"학교에","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학교에","audio":"/audio/73b845af583b8fb74d39.mp3"}},{"text":"올","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올","audio":"/audio/d4e5ba0f9d89e82785b6.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"혼자","meaning":"独自，单独","explanation":"혼자：独自，单独","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30207","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}},{"text":"오니?","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오니","audio":"/audio/aa5f29e49987c6019006.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到；来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"9d309cd460ea409c","term":"혼자","zh":"独自，单独","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3","entryId":"30207","definition":"只有一人，没有别人。","pronunciation":["혼자"]}],"audio":"/audio/0e04da527914f44bac60.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n54012-1-9-2","ko":"아니요, 같은 동에 사는 지수하고 함께 와요.","zh":"不是，我和住在同一个社区的智秀一起来的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요,","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}},{"text":"같은","meaning":"相同，一样，一致","explanation":"같다：相同，一样，一致；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"1","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은","audio":"/audio/9dce73570f65f8a11961.mp3"}},{"text":"동에","meaning":"洞","explanation":"동：洞；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"동","audio":"/audio/70d46f8c1cc5dc7aa4df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54012","senseId":"1","lemma":"동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"